# TLSET: stage lock blocks the launch-mode clear while playing, and only then. TPOL r1: the lock
# only refuses a hold once it passes the 250 ms tap threshold. A HOME + tap still launches now,
# with no LOCKED toast; a refused hold neither clears nor launches the clip it refused.
wait 300
tap SEQ
tap HOME
tap SEL
expect liveque0 0
press PLAY
wait 700
release PLAY
wait 100
tap EDIT
turn SELECT 2 80
turn ALGO 1 80
expect stagelock 1
tap EDIT
press PLAY
wait 700
release PLAY
wait 100
tap PLAY
wait-bar 1
expect liveclip0 0
# a HOME + tap launches now with the lock on, and no LOCKED toast appears (the lock does not touch a tap)
press HOME
key 1 down
wait 80
shot lock_tap.png
expect sttoast 0
key 1 up
release HOME
wait 100
expect liveclip0 1
# a refused HOME + hold (past 250 ms) shows LOCKED, keeps the clip and does not launch it either
press HOME
key w0 down
wait 1700
expect sttoast 1
key w0 up
release HOME
wait 100
expect clipused0 1
expect liveclip0 1
# stopped: the same hold clears
tap PLAY
wait 300
press HOME
key w0 down
wait 1700
key w0 up
release HOME
expect clipused0 0
